      "questionTextEn": "If f(x) = 2x - 3 and g(x) = x^2 + 1, what is the value of f(g(2)) - g(f(2))?",
      "optionsEn": [
        "5",
        "9",
        "3",
        "7"
      ],
      "explanationEn": "g(2) = 2^2 + 1 = 5, so f(g(2)) = f(5) = 2(5) - 3 = 7. Also f(2) = 2(2) - 3 = 1, so g(f(2)) = g(1) = 1^2 + 1 = 2. Difference = 7 - 2 = 5."
