        "9",
        "6",
        "8"
      ],
      "explanationEn": "For -2 <= x <= 3, |x-3| + |x+2| = 5 <= 7 (6 integers: -2,-1,0,1,2,3). For x > 3: 2x - 1 <= 7 => x <= 4 (gives x = 4). For x < -2: 1 - 2x <= 7 => x >= -3 (gives x = -3). Total integers = 6 + 1 + 1 = 8."
